<h1>Timmy Knudsen</h1>
<p>43rd Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.knudsenfor43.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (knudsenfor43.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Began collecting petition signatures for reelection in July 2026 and announced his reelection bid in a video in August 2026. His campaign site has not been updated for 2027; its earlier platform emphasized public safety investments such as security cameras and community policing, blocking property tax hikes, and protecting fundamental rights.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>43rd Ward alderman since 2022 (appointed, then elected in 2023); former attorney and law firm partner working with start-ups, and chair of the Chicago Zoning Board of Appeals.</p>
